            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:rights>
         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Workers inspect oranges on the production line at a Sucocitrico Cutrale LTDA orange juice plant in Araraquara, Brazil, on Friday, Nov. 26, 2010. Sucocitrico Cutrale makes about 30 percent of global orange-juice supplies. Photographer: Marcos Issa/Bloomberg via Getty Images</rdf:li>
